WEBVTT

00:08.140 --> 00:09.830
The Media Cleansing Act.

00:12.490 --> 00:17.880
It's a law that regulates publications that violate the privacy and sanctity of public order and traditions.

00:19.740 --> 00:23.260
Censorship is carried out by the Media Cleansing Committee.

00:25.000 --> 00:27.890
Its jurisdiction was arbitrarily expanded,

00:27.890 --> 00:32.120
and the use of force is permitted against anyone who resists.

00:36.220 --> 00:41.000
The final volume of my favorite children's book series was finally published after ten years!

00:43.990 --> 00:45.450
We have a message for you.

00:45.450 --> 00:46.950
Read it.

00:46.950 --> 00:50.920
We shall carry out the censorship in accordance with Article 3 of the Media Cleansing Act.

00:50.920 --> 00:54.460
Keep all publications in the store.

01:00.090 --> 01:03.050
It's been designated as one of the censored books!

01:07.680 --> 01:09.690
What are you hiding there?!

01:09.690 --> 01:11.690
It's one of the books in question.

01:11.690 --> 01:14.360
N-No! Give it back!

01:14.360 --> 01:15.220
Hand it over!

01:15.220 --> 01:17.570
Or do you want to visit the police station for shoplifting?!

01:19.730 --> 01:20.490
I will.

01:20.490 --> 01:21.890
What?

01:22.530 --> 01:27.160
I'm shoplifting, so I'll go to the police station with this book.

01:27.690 --> 01:28.500
Shut up!

01:28.500 --> 01:29.690
Hand it over!

01:29.690 --> 01:30.720
Give it to me!

01:30.720 --> 01:32.660
No!

01:33.770 --> 01:36.190
This is the Kanto Library Force

01:54.050 --> 01:58.650
usu murasaki hirogaru

01:54.050 --> 01:58.650
The faint purple spreads across the sky

01:58.650 --> 02:06.630
orenji iro ni kawaru mado no soto

01:58.650 --> 02:06.630
The color changes to orange outside the window

02:06.630 --> 02:10.680
yoru wa mou bai bai

02:06.630 --> 02:10.680
The night's already "bye-bye"

02:11.230 --> 02:16.920
tada kirei na mono wo kirei to

02:11.230 --> 02:16.920
I just want to be someone who

02:16.920 --> 02:21.480
ieru atashi de itai

02:16.920 --> 02:21.480
calls beautiful things beautiful

02:21.480 --> 02:27.820
ima wa dokidoki shitai no

02:21.480 --> 02:27.820
I want to get excited for it!

02:28.350 --> 02:32.880
fumidashichae tomaranai

02:28.350 --> 02:32.880
So I step out, unstoppable

02:32.880 --> 02:37.470
zenbu te ni hairi sou de

02:32.880 --> 02:37.470
And take everything into my own hands

02:37.960 --> 02:42.070
sono saki de aitai

02:37.960 --> 02:42.070
Beyond there, I want to meet

02:42.070 --> 02:48.060
mita koto no nai atashi

02:42.070 --> 02:48.060
the new self that I've never seen

02:48.530 --> 02:53.180
sayonara daisuki na machi

02:48.530 --> 02:53.180
Farewell, my beloved town

02:53.180 --> 02:57.730
atashi mo ganbatte miru yo

02:53.180 --> 02:57.730
I'll try to do my best

02:57.730 --> 03:05.290
kono sora no tsuzuku basho de

02:57.730 --> 03:05.290
somewhere under the same sky

03:10.460 --> 03:14.910
Situation 01

03:10.460 --> 03:14.910
My Prince Is In
A Library Force

03:15.280 --> 03:19.050
Year of Seika 31

03:19.680 --> 03:23.420
Kanto Library Base

03:30.310 --> 03:33.120
Kasahara Iku

03:30.370 --> 03:31.370
Defence Force (In Training)

03:31.370 --> 03:32.080
Rank: Librarian First Class

03:32.080 --> 03:32.750
Age: 22 Height: 170cm

03:32.750 --> 03:33.120
Hot-headed Idiot

03:33.160 --> 03:35.500
Keep your arms up, Kasahara!

03:35.850 --> 03:36.900
Yes, Sir!

03:49.860 --> 03:51.890
Who gave you permission to fall down?

03:51.890 --> 03:53.520
Do push-ups as punishment!

03:57.450 --> 04:00.370
Dojo Atsushi

03:57.460 --> 03:58.460
Defence Force, Library Task Force

03:57.720 --> 04:00.360
That damn instructor!

03:58.460 --> 03:59.170
Rank: Library Officer Second Class

03:59.170 --> 03:59.840
Age: 27 Height: 165cm

03:59.840 --> 04:00.370
Angry Shorty

04:02.140 --> 04:06.030
I swear, that damn instructor has a grudge against me!

04:06.030 --> 04:09.030
By "damn instructor" you mean Instructor Dojo?

04:09.030 --> 04:12.580
He never gives the other girls similar punishments when they fall down.

04:12.580 --> 04:14.790
And I only went down after I crossed the goal line!

04:14.790 --> 04:17.560
What does he have against me?!

04:17.560 --> 04:20.050
I actually like him a little.

04:20.770 --> 04:22.250
Isn't he kind of cool?

04:22.250 --> 04:24.590
Huh?! How?!

04:24.590 --> 04:26.050
That shorty?!

04:26.050 --> 04:28.810
Sure, he's a little on the short side,

04:28.810 --> 04:33.010
but there'll be nobody left if you get picky about height.

04:34.720 --> 04:37.140
Either way, he's out of the question.

04:38.140 --> 04:40.220
He has a nasty personality, too.

04:42.660 --> 04:46.320
So that's what you think of me.

04:46.970 --> 04:49.890
A short, damned instructor with a nasty character, huh?

04:50.400 --> 04:52.060
W-Well...

04:52.060 --> 04:53.900
I'm only human.

04:53.900 --> 04:58.290
I can't guarantee that any trash-talking I hear won't affect my instructing later on.

04:59.040 --> 05:00.250
You had better be ready for hell.

05:01.750 --> 05:04.700
I was praising you, so I'm safe, right?

05:04.470 --> 05:10.320
Traitor

05:04.700 --> 05:06.510
You traitor!

05:06.510 --> 05:09.170
But this isn't the instructors' cafeteria.

05:09.170 --> 05:10.300
Why did you come here?

05:10.300 --> 05:12.840
There are too many old folks over there.

05:13.380 --> 05:15.990
And the food is basically vegetarian.

05:17.890 --> 05:20.750
Komaki Mikihisa

05:17.900 --> 05:18.900
Defence Force, Library Task Force

05:18.900 --> 05:19.610
Rank: Library Officer Second Class

05:19.610 --> 05:20.280
Age: 27 Height: 175cm

05:20.280 --> 05:20.750
Smiling Logician

05:20.730 --> 05:22.650
Let's go, Shibasaki.

05:26.500 --> 05:28.320
Hey, you dropped something.

05:28.320 --> 05:30.150
It's a letter I couldn't finish writing.

05:30.150 --> 05:31.360
Please throw it away.

05:32.410 --> 05:34.570
But didn't you write this for your parents back in the countryside?

05:34.570 --> 05:37.060
I folded it up because I can't send it.

05:37.060 --> 05:40.170
They'd force me to come home if they ever read that.

05:44.990 --> 05:52.320
Father, Mother, how are you?
I am doing fine.
I heard the air in Tokyo isn't
clean, but Musashino isn't
terrible about it.
I'm getting used to life in the
dorm, and my roommate and I
are always together. We get
along very well.
I was finally hired by the library
force that I've always wanted to
join. Now I am training every
single day.

05:53.950 --> 05:58.270
The Media Cleansing Act was passed at the dawn of the Seika era.

05:53.950 --> 05:58.270
Note: Seika era is a fictional era name.

05:59.510 --> 06:04.380
Using it as an excuse to preserve human rights and protect young citizens from the media's bad influence,

06:04.380 --> 06:09.190
the armed forces started cracking down on the freedom of expression.

06:15.870 --> 06:23.670
Around the same time, the Library Freedom Act was passed to counter the Media Cleansing Act.

06:24.540 --> 06:27.080
Libraries, falling under the jurisdiction of the local governments,

06:27.080 --> 06:29.360
used this law as grounds to oppose the central government,

06:29.550 --> 06:32.770
and eventually formed the Defense Organization for self-defense purposes.

06:35.640 --> 06:38.640
The conflict between the two only escalated over the years.

06:38.640 --> 06:43.600
In the thirty years since those laws were passed, it has grown into a full-fledged war.

06:46.810 --> 06:49.420
So, how is she?

06:49.900 --> 06:51.560
She's a monster.

06:52.000 --> 06:55.490
Note: High port is a running exercise while carrying the rifle at chest height.

06:52.120 --> 06:55.490
She came in twelfth in the co-ed high port training exercise.

06:56.950 --> 06:59.780
I heard she was on the track and field team in high school.

06:59.780 --> 07:03.180
She has enough athletic ability, so she would do great even in the JSDF.

07:05.000 --> 07:08.170
She's really something to make you talk so much about her.

07:08.170 --> 07:10.690
Wouldn't that just about make her a shoe-in?

07:11.520 --> 07:12.820
Not yet.

07:13.220 --> 07:15.990
The assessment isn't based on physical ability alone.

07:23.180 --> 07:24.350
Kasahara, you're too strong.

07:24.350 --> 07:25.660
I give up.

07:27.110 --> 07:29.360
Kasahara, team up with me.

07:30.940 --> 07:33.500
<b>Sign: </b>Be quiet in the dorms

07:31.350 --> 07:34.440
Man, what's wrong with him?!

07:34.440 --> 07:37.030
I heard you fought with Instructor Dojo again?

07:38.450 --> 07:41.030
He provoked me!

07:41.030 --> 07:43.250
He told me to make him fall face forward.

07:43.250 --> 07:46.290
But still, who would drop kick someone there?

07:46.290 --> 07:50.250
But he put me in an upper cross arm armlock, too!

07:52.250 --> 07:56.720
I heard that nobody lasts longer than three seconds when caught in that armlock.

07:57.100 --> 07:59.180
You lasted ten seconds, right?

07:59.710 --> 08:05.980
So gentle that he's always merciful, even with a wild monkey.

08:02.120 --> 08:04.980
Shibasaki Asako

08:02.130 --> 08:03.130
Defence Force, In Training

08:03.130 --> 08:03.840
Rank: Librarian First Class

08:03.840 --> 08:04.510
Age: 22 Height: 157cm

08:04.510 --> 08:04.980
Informant

08:05.980 --> 08:08.940
I'm starting to like him more and more.

08:08.940 --> 08:10.940
Who are you calling a wild monkey?

08:10.940 --> 08:13.530
You aren't one?

08:16.390 --> 08:21.100
By the way, you haven't told your parents that you were assigned to the Defense Force, have you?

08:22.140 --> 08:23.100
No.

08:23.660 --> 08:27.290
What are you going to do when they want to see your workplace?

08:28.310 --> 08:34.300
You might be able to trick them into thinking you were assigned to the Task Force, since they also handle library administration.

08:34.300 --> 08:41.140
With Task Force, do you mean that super elite group that consists of but the best members?

08:42.600 --> 08:45.460
Well, I do admire them, but...

08:45.460 --> 08:47.810
I guess a new recruit like you wouldn't stand a chance...

08:48.370 --> 08:53.570
So why'd you apply for the Defense Force in the first place if you knew they were against it?

08:53.570 --> 08:55.490
Well, that's...

08:55.490 --> 08:59.580
Wait, how do you know what my first choice was?!

08:59.580 --> 09:02.740
There are tricks on how to expand the information network.

09:02.740 --> 09:04.950
So damn sly...

09:04.950 --> 09:07.290
So, why?

09:11.050 --> 09:13.790
O-O-Ow!

09:13.790 --> 09:16.910
My arm hurts; I'm going to sleep.

09:16.910 --> 09:18.550
Good night!

09:29.000 --> 09:32.020
He's a hero of justice!

09:39.020 --> 09:40.730
Go pay for this

09:41.740 --> 09:44.950
But isn't the library confiscating all of them?

09:45.380 --> 09:47.110
Not all of them

09:47.460 --> 09:49.410
We give some back anyways.

09:51.750 --> 09:56.750
You're the one who tried to protect this
and risked being charged for shoplifting.

10:09.140 --> 10:11.120
I'd like this.

10:11.120 --> 10:13.310
The cover is damaged.

10:13.310 --> 10:14.850
I'll go get a new one.

10:14.850 --> 10:16.450
Please give me this one.

10:16.930 --> 10:18.690
I want this one.

10:25.880 --> 10:29.050
It was you who tried to protect this book.

10:34.050 --> 10:40.080
And he was very admirable, wonderful, gallant, and looked dependable.

10:40.700 --> 10:42.510
So...

10:42.510 --> 10:43.770
Yes?

10:46.850 --> 10:50.680
I want to protect books, just like that man!

10:52.260 --> 10:58.880
I'm here right now because they recognized my passion that day.

11:08.350 --> 11:12.620
Well, that's about all there is to this facility.

11:09.640 --> 11:12.790
Classroom Training

11:13.170 --> 11:15.960
I'm sure you learned about it in your lectures, too.

11:17.900 --> 11:19.960
Well, um...

11:20.810 --> 11:23.630
I don't do well in lectures.

11:25.210 --> 11:26.430
Oh well.

11:26.430 --> 11:28.390
I won't tell Dojo.

11:30.660 --> 11:32.020
Don't worry about him.

11:34.750 --> 11:36.980
Do you hate Dojo that much?

11:36.980 --> 11:41.940
I think he hates me more.

11:41.940 --> 11:43.530
That's not true.

11:43.530 --> 11:45.070
Then why me?

11:45.070 --> 11:48.210
Can't you take a hint that he cares about you more than the others?

11:48.210 --> 11:49.290
Never.

11:51.760 --> 11:56.210
Have you thought about why he's so strict on you alone?

11:58.670 --> 12:03.420
Since he's not quite fair to you, I'll give you a hint.

12:03.420 --> 12:06.810
Kasahara-san, you were on the track and field team, right?

12:07.350 --> 12:08.470
Yes.

12:08.470 --> 12:11.300
Are track and field and P.T. similar?

12:19.620 --> 12:21.020
Why the long face?

12:21.820 --> 12:25.490
I could ask you the same question!

12:28.620 --> 12:31.670
Instructor Komaki, I can't after all.

12:40.120 --> 12:42.700
Does he look suspicious to you, too?

12:42.700 --> 12:44.490
Possibly.

12:44.490 --> 12:46.130
Question him.

12:46.130 --> 12:47.050
Yes, Sir.

12:50.800 --> 12:53.010
Hey! What are you doing?!

13:01.100 --> 13:04.570
Compared to Dojo, he's...

13:05.120 --> 13:06.030
totally...

13:06.030 --> 13:07.240
slow!

13:07.800 --> 13:09.110
Don't underestimate me!

13:12.440 --> 13:13.240
Kasahara!

13:14.870 --> 13:17.950
I captured the man that was vandalizing the library book!

13:17.950 --> 13:19.410
Are you an idiot?!

13:24.360 --> 13:26.090
I-Instructor!

13:26.090 --> 13:27.730
Stay out of this!

13:32.550 --> 13:33.680
Ow! Ow! Ow!

13:45.230 --> 13:48.190
Don't say you've captured him when you don't even have him restrained!

13:48.740 --> 13:51.300
Quit the force if this is just a sport to you!

14:09.390 --> 14:13.000
Hey, how long are you going to sulk like this?

14:13.520 --> 14:15.130
Cheer up.

14:15.130 --> 14:19.910
I saw that Instructor Dojo submitted the report with you as the one who captured that guy.

14:22.630 --> 14:25.270
He probably acknowledges people when he needs to.

14:34.320 --> 14:37.160
Are track and field and P.T. similar?

14:39.620 --> 14:42.580
Quit the force if this is just a sport to you!

14:47.830 --> 14:48.960
Why...?

14:48.960 --> 14:51.730
What are you doing here?

14:53.260 --> 14:55.680
Why do you have to show up now?

14:56.720 --> 14:58.920
This place is for both men and women!

14:58.920 --> 15:00.850
You have no right to complain.

15:03.020 --> 15:04.520
No!

15:04.520 --> 15:06.850
That's not what I want to say!

15:07.410 --> 15:09.690
I just heard from Shibasaki.

15:09.690 --> 15:12.490
Why did you put me down as the one who captured him?

15:16.990 --> 15:21.160
You think you're great enough to question what your superior officer puts in his reports?

15:21.160 --> 15:23.960
That's not my point!

15:27.880 --> 15:29.350
No!

15:29.350 --> 15:30.670
Don't cry!

15:33.130 --> 15:37.430
I have no right to be the capturer, so...

15:43.740 --> 15:44.390
Go to sleep.

15:45.710 --> 15:47.550
I won't quit!

15:47.550 --> 15:48.270
What?

15:48.270 --> 15:53.480
I came here because I wanted to become like the library officer I met when I was in high school.

15:53.980 --> 15:58.350
If I ever see him, I'll tell him that I came here because of him!

15:58.350 --> 16:01.230
So I won't quit until then!

16:05.440 --> 16:06.580
Suit yourself.

16:14.690 --> 16:17.160
I heard Dojo slapped you.

16:17.160 --> 16:18.400
Is the swelling gone?

16:18.400 --> 16:21.360
Y-Yes, th-thank you.

16:21.360 --> 16:24.390
He's really stubborn.

16:24.390 --> 16:27.330
Do me a favor and forgive him.

16:27.330 --> 16:30.020
No, it was my fault.

16:30.020 --> 16:32.330
I put him in danger.

16:32.330 --> 16:35.640
The instructor is responsible for mishaps during training.

16:35.640 --> 16:37.300
He's sorry for what happened too.

16:38.800 --> 16:40.260
He is?

16:40.260 --> 16:42.970
He looked really bummed.

16:42.970 --> 16:45.760
He almost injured you.

16:45.760 --> 16:47.460
But...

16:47.460 --> 16:52.280
He told me not to tell you about this, so I'm just mumbling to myself.

16:52.850 --> 16:54.060
Right.

16:59.500 --> 17:02.150
Instructor Genda, isn't that...?

17:02.150 --> 17:04.020
Good work noticing that.

17:04.020 --> 17:05.360
It's a Cleansing Committee vehicle.

17:05.360 --> 17:09.060
Are they going to attack the library?

17:09.060 --> 17:10.580
No, this is too close.

17:11.210 --> 17:13.900
They typically employ surprise attacks.

17:13.900 --> 17:17.290
My guess is they are after the large bookstore in the shopping center.

17:17.290 --> 17:18.830
Then we'd better go!

17:18.830 --> 17:20.520
Not so fast.

17:20.520 --> 17:24.400
Our resistance is limited to the confines of the library facility.

17:24.400 --> 17:26.590
We can't expand our effort to the town.

17:28.080 --> 17:30.780
Are we going to let them censor whatever they want?!

17:30.780 --> 17:32.400
Don't forget who we are.

17:31.520 --> 17:34.420
Genda Ryusuke

17:31.530 --> 17:32.530
Defence Force, Captain

17:32.400 --> 17:34.440
We are not heroes of justice.

17:32.530 --> 17:33.240
Rank: Library Supervisor Third Class

17:33.240 --> 17:33.910
Age: 43 Height: 185cm

17:33.910 --> 17:34.420
Middle-aged Wrangler

17:37.740 --> 17:41.350
But we have the Rule of Book Selection.

17:43.160 --> 17:44.450
Wait!

17:49.870 --> 17:51.220
Hello?

17:51.220 --> 17:53.330
Your rookie's about to be in big trouble!

17:53.830 --> 17:55.080
Come right now!

17:55.080 --> 17:57.960
I went after her, but she's too damn fast.

18:01.460 --> 18:02.700
Stop it!

18:02.700 --> 18:04.150
Please! Give it back!

18:04.150 --> 18:05.300
No!

18:05.300 --> 18:06.550
Please!

18:06.550 --> 18:08.010
Give it back to me!

18:09.750 --> 18:11.560
What are you people doing?

18:13.330 --> 18:15.180
This is the Kanto Library Force.

18:19.610 --> 18:20.900
See!

18:20.900 --> 18:25.590
I hereby designate these books as Library Book Selections

18:25.590 --> 18:27.600
in accordance with Library Law Article 30 regarding book collection

18:27.600 --> 18:30.010
and by my executive authority as a Librarian First Class.

18:36.260 --> 18:38.670
You've got a big mouth for a mere Librarian.

18:38.670 --> 18:44.130
The right of Book Selection is only given to Library Officers and above.

18:48.050 --> 18:49.840
Dang it!

18:50.420 --> 18:52.510
I should have studied harder!

18:52.510 --> 18:55.100
I'll have you return this book.

18:55.100 --> 18:56.530
No! Don't!

18:56.530 --> 18:59.020
Are you going to resist?

19:03.150 --> 19:03.770
No!

19:05.460 --> 19:07.150
This is the Kanto Library Force!

19:08.890 --> 19:11.160
What's with this timing...?

19:19.310 --> 19:23.420
A little late, but we have two Library Officers Second Class and one Library Supervisor Third Class.

19:24.810 --> 19:25.920
That should be enough.

19:35.430 --> 19:37.350
Are you an idiot?!

19:37.840 --> 19:40.460
You let the Cleansing Committee teach you a lesson!

19:40.460 --> 19:42.440
Did you pay attention at all during the lectures?

19:42.440 --> 19:44.070
I'm sorry!

19:44.070 --> 19:47.140
Furthermore, the library has to purchase the books we select!

19:47.140 --> 19:50.650
Imagine what would happen if officers kept selecting books that aren't in the budget!

19:50.650 --> 19:53.490
But that man did the same thing!

19:53.490 --> 19:54.910
He's an idiot too!

19:54.910 --> 19:57.790
Don't imitate an idiot, you idiot!

19:58.360 --> 20:00.830
Don't call him an idiot!

20:00.830 --> 20:01.900
Shut up!

20:01.900 --> 20:04.540
He is a reckless, rule-breaking idiot!

20:04.540 --> 20:07.000
It's best if he quits too!

20:07.000 --> 20:09.950
Stop badmouthing my prince!

20:09.950 --> 20:11.630
I can't contain myself any more.

20:11.630 --> 20:13.720
You're something else, Kasahara-san.

20:18.170 --> 20:19.640
Go give it to that kid.

20:21.220 --> 20:22.610
I can?

20:22.610 --> 20:24.830
That's the part of him you really want to imitate, isn't it?

20:25.610 --> 20:26.980
Thank you, Sir!

20:30.500 --> 20:31.950
A prince, huh?

20:33.730 --> 20:35.700
Your rival is tough.

20:35.700 --> 20:37.410
I don't understand what you mean.

20:37.410 --> 20:40.490
Anyway, I think she's the one.

20:40.490 --> 20:41.940
Any objections?

20:41.940 --> 20:43.050
Of course not.

20:45.850 --> 20:47.810
Human Resource Manager

20:57.410 --> 20:58.040
NOTICE

20:57.410 --> 20:58.040
KASAHARA IKU

20:58.200 --> 20:58.830
YOU ARE TO REPORT TO

20:59.000 --> 20:59.890
THE LIBRARY TASK FORCE

20:59.930 --> 21:01.860
What?!

21:01.860 --> 21:04.730
I'm to join the Task Force?!

21:06.710 --> 21:10.050
nani ka ga kawaru kigashita

21:06.710 --> 21:10.050
